<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Tadej&#039;s Criss-cross Tempo</name><description>Train Like Tadej for the Giro-Tour Double with Criss-cross Tempo. This is a challenging session that tests both your aerobic and anaerobic energy systems. Criss-cross Tempo is a great session that simulates the demands of racing by forcing you to recover at a high power output. This session consists of 2x8min Criss-cross Tempo (1min at 95% FTP followed by 3min at 80% FTP) with 4min recovery.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>
